+        "by": [
+          "sourceFactId"
+        ]
+      },
+      "description": "Zero or more TargetAttributionV2 records. Each item MUST admit as foundation/target-attribution.schema.v2.json via registered $ref opensip.product.target-attribution.2 (full selected schema including allOf; validators MUST NOT mutate this dictionary at import time to embed the sibling). Strict unique utf-8 order by sourceFactId. Duplicate sourceFactId refuses. Empty array is a present incomplete return (all omitted facts occupancy-unknown except exact-id ephemeral), distinct from a missing envelope."
