+  "x-opensip-return-law": {
+    "standing": "Current delivery is negotiated FactBatchV3 occupancy companions plus host mechanical projection. The frame name FactBatch is unchanged. Historical FactBatchV2/FactCandidateV1 stay closed when the token is absent. The envelope schema is not the worker channel.",
+    "boundary": {
+      "compilerWorkerTransport": "FactCandidateV1 unchanged. When Hello negotiates target-attribution-v2, FactBatch payload is FactBatchV3 carrying occupancyCompanions associated by candidateOrdinal BEFORE fact2 exists. When the token is absent, FactBatchV2 remains and occupancy is unknown except exact-id ephemeral.",
+      "providerWrapper": "The language wrapper RUNS IN THE WORKER process, before FactBatch emit, while compiler-native resolution is still in memory. It encodes opaque SubjectIdV1 into FactCandidateV1.canonicalRelationPayload AND emits OccupancyCompanionV1 in the same batch. It does not run after host fact2 mint. There is no post-FactBatch shared table.",
