+        "minted_by_ordinal": "host mint map candidateOrdinal \u2192 fact2 of THIS batch only, verified against this batch's candidates. Prior-batch facts are not required in this map.",
+        "inventories": "admitted SubjectInventoryV1",
+        "enumerationPlan": "EnumerationPlanV1",
+        "prior_records": "already-captured TargetAttributionV2 from prior batches of this Plan. Combined occupancy-conflict uses sidecars only (AM._admit_provider_occupancy_conflicts does not use facts). Current-batch TARGET_ATTRIBUTION_FACT_NOT_IN_PLAN uses THIS batch mint map only."
