+      "law": "If ephemeral exact-id occupancy is first-party identity I_eph AND sidecar occupancy is first-party identity I_sc AND I_eph \u2260 I_sc, refuse TARGET_ATTRIBUTION_EPHEMERAL_IDENTITY_CONFLICT. Independently known identity cannot be silently rewritten by a contradictory provider mapping. Occupancy identity is (kind, evaluationNativeId) for file/symbol and (kind, evaluationNativeId, packageManifestPath) for package.",
+      "reproducibleOperand": "Inventory contains file nativeSubjectId=file:src/a.ts (SubjectIdV1 spelling that is also a LogicalPath) AND file nativeSubjectId=src/b.ts. Payload resolvedTarget exactly equals file:src/a.ts, so ephemeral I_eph is first-party file:src/a.ts. Sidecar occupancy=first-party evaluationNativeId=src/b.ts joins the other inventory row. Join of kind/exists succeeds; identity disagrees. Refuse. Do not overwrite ephemeral nativeId with src/b.ts.",
+      "agreement": "Sidecar first-party identity equal to I_eph is admitted (sidecar+ephemeral). Sidecar occupancy=unknown keeps ephemeral. Sidecar occupancy=external while ephemeral is first-party remains TARGET_ATTRIBUTION_EXTERNAL_CONTRADICTS_FIRST_PARTY."
+    }
